type: software
title: "AbsorbAI: Clinical Pharmacokinetic Decision-Support Platform"
abstract: "Clinical decision-support platform simulating personalized drug behavior across ~45 drugs for doctor and patient roles. Features a 10-layer PK/PD engine, Monte Carlo uncertainty quantification, Bayesian updates, a pharmacological knowledge graph, and Gemma 1.5B LLM integration."
